      },
      "message": "docs: first-part example project with rendered tutorial images (#291)\n\nexamples/first-part.camproj: a flange-with-holes fixture built end to\nend (model -> stock -> Face / 2D Pocket / Drill -> verify -> G-code),\nplus its clean-room OBJ and the generator that made it.\n\ndocs/images/first-part-*.png are golden files: the docs test in\ncrates/ui/tests/gpu_render.rs opens the project, steps through the\noperation order, and renders each step with the real viewport and the\nreal toolpath display (interact::toolpath_lines, made pub). A normal\nrun compares against the committed pictures; UPDATE_DOCS_IMAGES=1\nregenerates them, same workflow as the kittest snapshots.\n\nThe gpu_render binary now renders every frame on one shared fallback\ndevice (OnceLock): per-frame device create/teardown was the binary's\nbiggest wgpu churn, and the frames read back identical.",
